## LOW: PERF (Test Performance)

### PERF-001: Parallel Tests

```typescript
// TypeScript (Vitest)
describe.concurrent('API tests', () => {
  it('should fetch users', async () => { /* ... */ });
  it('should fetch posts', async () => { /* ... */ });
});
```

```python
# Python (pytest)
# pytest.ini or pyproject.toml
# [tool.pytest.ini_options]
# addopts = "-n auto"  # pytest-xdist for parallel
```

```go
// Go
func TestParallel(t *testing.T) {
    t.Parallel()
    // Test runs in parallel with other parallel tests
}
```

### PERF-002: Fast Feedback

```bash
# Watch mode for instant feedback
npm test -- --watch
pytest --watch
go test -v ./...
```

### PERF-003: Test Organization

```
src/
├── user/
│   ├── user.ts
│   ├── user.test.ts      # Unit tests co-located
│   └── user.spec.ts      # Integration tests
└── __tests__/
    └── integration/      # Or separate integration folder
```

