## Checklist

### Before Each TDD Cycle
- [ ] Understand the requirement clearly
- [ ] Write test name describing expected behavior
- [ ] Test fails for the right reason (not syntax error)

### After Implementation
- [ ] All tests pass
- [ ] Code is refactored
- [ ] No duplicate logic
- [ ] Test coverage meets threshold

### Code Review
- [ ] Tests written before code
- [ ] Tests are readable as documentation
- [ ] Edge cases covered
- [ ] No test interdependencies

